an-grade ingredients, which is what our best friends deserve.<\/p>"}},"accordion_item_aFBpWk":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"How long until I start seeing the benefits?","content":"<p>The benefits that most dogs feel—less itching, more activity, better mood—are just bonuses to improving their long-term health. If taken consistently on a daily basis, most dogs will start to see positive effects in about 6-8 weeks.<\/p>"}},"accordion_item_73Pckc":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"How many chews come in a jar?","content":"<p>There are <strong>60 Chews in each jar<\/strong>, which is a<\/p><ul><li>2-Monthly supply for Small Dogs (0-12kg).<\/li><li>Monthly supply for Medium dogs (12-34kg).<\/li><li>3-Weekly supply for Bigger dogs (34kg+).<\/li><\/ul>"}},"accordion_item_YtJCtH":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"What flavour is the Multivitamin?","content":"<p>Our Multivitamin is made with the highest quality human-grade chicken liver, a flavour that dogs absolutely love. In the case of a chicken allergy, we recommend our Beef flavour!<\/p>"}},"accordion_item_fDbPYA":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"What happens if I accidentally give my dog too many chews?","content":"<p>In the event that your dog accidentally consumes significantly more than the daily recommended dose, consult your vet for advice.<\/p>"}},"accordion_item_gGabaq":{"type":"accordion_item","settings":{"title":"Can I take this dog multivitamin with other supplements?","content":"<p>Our veterinary team formulated our Daily Vitamin with natural ingredients that can be taken both alone or as a complementary product with other common and more targeted pet supplements. Nevertheless, we still recommend checking with your vet.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["accordion_item_7y7jpe","accordion_item_Yp64jw","accordion_item_8TCkq4","accordion_item_aFBpWk","accordion_item_73Pckc","accordion_item_YtJCtH","accordion_item_fDbPYA","accordion_item_gGabaq"],"name":"Accordion - FAQ","settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions.."}}},"order":["main","related-products","175164698616a8c223","ss_testimonial_12_cg6i4k","clickable_testimonials_Vaw6Yx","ss_scrolling_logo_cloud_5_dkWVhR","ss_product_ingredients_6_fTneq7","faq_Ve68Dt"]}